      "Question": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Alice, a Server Administrator (Tomcat), wants to ensure that Tomcat can be shut down only by the user who owns the Tomcat process. Select the appropriate setting of the CATALINA_HOME/conf in server.xml that will enable him to do so."
